  "discription": {
    "note": "Strongly vertical perennial with whorls of narrow leaves along stiff stems and slender, candelabra-like spikes of white to pale lilac flowers in late summer. Long-lived, needs no staking and stands well into winter. Fresh root is strongly purgative.",
    "noteNL": "Sterk verticale vaste plant met kransen smalle bladeren langs stevige stengels en slanke, kandelaarachtige aren witte tot bleeklila bloemen in de nazomer. Langlevend, hoeft niet gesteund te worden en blijft mooi staan tot in de winter. De verse wortel werkt sterk laxerend."
